    if (id === 'door') return `<h4>🚪 ${say('轉送／到院', 'Transfer / arrival')}</h4><p class="small">${say('時間戳記：最後正常時間、到院、影像、決策、離院（DIDO）。每一段都要寫下來。', 'Time stamps: last known well, arrival, imaging, decision, door-out (DIDO). Write each one down.')}</p>`;
